{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15726","headline":"寄衞明府常见短靴褐裘又务持诵是以有末句之赠 · 司空曙","name":"寄衞明府常见短靴褐裘又务持诵是以有末句之赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柴桑官舍近东林，儿稚初髫即道心。\n侧寄绳牀嫌凭几，斜安苔帻嬾穿簪。\n高僧静望山僮逐，走吏喧来水鸭沈。\n翠竹黄花皆佛性，莫教尘境误相侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}